{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-mat-2605-0083","content_id":"f61f7a6d-ee0d-4111-b724-15e577d22068","description":"Product Recall for Urban Outfitters Sleepover Roll Mat presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e683480b-60db-403d-9d71-d928e68baeb9","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-29T12:42:30+01:00","id":"e683480b-60db-403d-9d71-d928e68baeb9","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-29T12:42:30+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a197ba6b95db968c8f3bc44/2605-0083-product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-matt.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Urban Outfitters Sleepover Roll Mat</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of fire because it was found that the outer cover fabric of the mattress failed the ‘match’ test.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Urban Outfitters.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Furniture - Household Mattresses</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Urban Outfitters</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>India</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Portable mattress available in various colours.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e683480b-60db-403d-9d71-d928e68baeb9\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a197ba6b95db968c8f3bc44/2605-0083-product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-matt.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-products\">Affected Products</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product name/ description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Web SKU</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product SKU</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Washed Velvet Single Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350001_066</td>\n      <td>90358961</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Washed Velvet Single Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350002_080</td>\n      <td>90377797</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350003_066</td>\n      <td>90377805</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350004_080</td>\n      <td>90377813</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350005_030</td>\n      <td>90377821</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tangerine Washed Velvet Single Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350014_080</td>\n      <td>98011943</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tangerine Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350017_080</td>\n      <td>98012305</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Chocolate Washed Velvet Single Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350015_020</td>\n      <td>98012107</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Chocolate Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350019_020</td>\n      <td>98012461</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Green Washed Velvet Single Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350016_030</td>\n      <td>980122976</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Green Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350018_030</td>\n      <td>98012396</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Ella Vine Single Washed Velvet Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350020_001</td>\n      <td>99639726</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Ella Vine Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350023_001</td>\n      <td>99640633</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Leopard Washed Velvet Single Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350021_020</td>\n      <td>99639932</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Leopard Washed Velvet Double Sleepover Mat</td>\n      <td>0520474350024_020</td>\n      <td>99640740</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of fire because it was found that the outer cover fabric of the mattress failed the ‘match’ test. The mattress may ignite and cause a fire when near a source of ignition.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Furniture and Furnishings (Fire) (Safety) Regulations 1988.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Urban Outfitters and is no longer available for sale.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers are advised to cease use of this product immediately and keep it away from any ignition source. For further information, including the returns process, please access the Urban Outfitters Website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.urbanoutfitters.com/en-gb/mattress-product-recall\">Mattress Product Recall</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:productrecalleu@urbn.com\">productrecalleu@urbn.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0083</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-29T11:43:04Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-products","level":3,"text":"Affected Products"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"furniture","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-29","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-29T12:43:04+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-mat-2605-0083","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-mat-2605-0083","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-mat-2605-0083","content_id":"f61f7a6d-ee0d-4111-b724-15e577d22068","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:43:04Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Urban Outfitters Sleepover Roll Mat (2605-0083)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-urban-outfitters-sleepover-roll-mat-2605-0083","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true